Short description:
Reconnect with familiar faces and meet new ones at our summer social. We’ll be enjoying delicious catering from <em>Pita</em> – falafel, pitta, hummus, pickles fresh salads, chips. We will also provide wine, beer and soft drinks. If the weather’s good, we’ll make the most of the garden too.

This event is open to everyone – all ages and backgrounds are welcome.

&nbsp;

We are launching a young professionals (ages 21–30) division, and so we’ll have a dedicated table to help build connections and community among this group so please indicate on the booking form if you are in this category.

All tickets £18

&nbsp;

